{"type":"text","timestamp":1789780537218,"sessionID":"ses_f48c53165ffeJRWMpDxfhPFhpo","part":{"id":"prt_0b73b9cb60012Xo2ENLCeUBzLw","messageID":"msg_0b73b96b5001wVP39AvQXkX7ft","sessionID":"ses_f48c53165ffeJRWMpDxfhPFhpo","type":"text","text":"Fixed in `src/search/controller.ts`.\n\n- Added a per-controller request counter so only the latest search can update results, errors, or loading.\n- Clearing the query immediately resets results, errors, and loading, and invalidates pending requests so they cannot restore stale state.\n- Preserved the public API and normal search behavior.\n\n**Verification:** `npm test` passed all 4 existing tests. `git diff --check` passed. No tests were modified and no dependencies were installed.","time":{"start":1789780532406,"end":1789780537216},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0e2895906df7c059016aade234620487d191856ab61803660e","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
